<span class="badge badge-expired">Expired</span>

<h2>Reservation Hold Expired</h2>

<p>Hello <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,</p>

<p>Your pending parking reservation hold for <strong>{{bookingReference}}</strong> at <strong>{{facilityName}}</strong> has expired because the reservation was not completed within the hold window.</p>

<table class="details-table">
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Booking Reference</td>
    <td class="value">{{bookingReference}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Parking Facility</td>
    <td class="value">{{facilityName}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Requested Date</td>
    <td class="value">{{bookingDate}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Scheduled Start</td>
    <td class="value">{{startTime}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Scheduled End</td>
    <td class="value">{{endTime}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{#if message}}
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Details</td>
    <td class="value">{{message}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
</table>

<div class="alert-box alert-info">
  <strong>Reservation Hold Expired:</strong> This pending reservation hold is no longer active. If you still need parking, you can easily create a new reservation through the ParkEase mobile app or web portal.
</div>
